"creator/commit/9133b1516>`__\\ )، مع مكتبتي ``libpython3.13`` و\\ ``ujson`` "
"المشتركتين الأصليتين (\\ `d3aa663d8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d3aa663d8>`__\\ ، `a2cb24e74 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/a2cb24e74>`__\\ )."

